embership-intro-label"><span class="tabular-nums">01</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Belonging</span></h2><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-muted-foreground">Applications open for 2027</p></div><p class="mt-12 max-w-[68rem] text-[clamp(1.6rem,3.5vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em] lg:mt-16 [&amp;_em]:font-serif [&amp;_em]:font-normal" data-intro-statement="true">Membership is capped at 650, so the course <em>always has room for you</em> and the terrace always has your table.</p><div class="mt-16 grid gap-10 lg:mt-24 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-12 lg:col-span-4 lg:py-4"><p class="max-w-md text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75" data-reveal="true">Morrow is a members’ club that welcomes guests, not the other way round. Members book first, play at the quietest hours and know the people pouring their coffee by name.</p><dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">members at most, so the course always has room</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,3rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="650" data-decimals="0">650</span></span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">between every group on the tee sheet</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,3rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="12" data-decimals="0">12</span> min</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">days ahead for member tee times</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp