lass="font-serif font-normal">the long game.</em></h2></div><div class="self-end lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75" data-reveal="true">Membership is capped at 650 so the course never feels crowded. Tee times run every twelve minutes, the practice ground is yours from first light, and the clubhouse is kept for members and their guests.</p><p class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-charcoal/15 bg-paper px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-charcoal/80" data-reveal="true"><span class="relative flex size-2"><span class="absolute inset-0 animate-ping rounded-full bg-clay/60 motion-reduce:hidden"></span><span class="relative size-2 rounded-full bg-clay"></span></span>Applications open for 2027</p></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand mt-14 aspect-[4/5] rounded-[4px] sm:aspect-[16/9] lg:mt-20 lg:aspect-[21/9]" data-mask="center"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="10"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="Two golfers walking side by side down a wide fairway at sunrise" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/golf-members.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center 60%;color:transparent"/></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/80 via-pine/10 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex flex-col gap-3 p-5 text-bone sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between sm:p-8 lg:p-10"><p class="max-w-xl font-serif text-[clamp(1.9rem,4vw,3.6rem)] leading-[1.02]">The best light belongs to members.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-bone/80 sm:text-[11px]">Member tee times from 07:00 daily</p></div></div><div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:mt-20 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-6"><artic