th="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-charcoal/85">Tee times bookable 30 days ahead</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-forest" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-charcoal/85">Full clubhouse and dining privileges</span></li></ul><div class="mt-auto pt-10"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-charcoal/50">By application</p><button aria-label="Enquire about International membership" class="mt-4 flex h-12 w-full items-center justify-between rounded-full px-5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors border border-charcoal/20 hover:border-charcoal hover:bg-charcoal hover:text-bone" type="button">Enquire<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></article><article class="group flex flex-col rounded-[6px] border p-6 transition-[translate,box-shadow,border-color] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 lg:p-7 border-charcoal/15 bg-paper hover:border-charcoal/40 hover:shadow-[0_40px_80px_-50px_rgba(27,27,25,0.45)]" data-reveal="true"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/50">03</span></div><h3 class="type-wide mt-10 text-[1.7rem] font-medium uppercase leading-none">Weekday</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal/65">Monday to Thursday, from first light.</p><ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-sm"><li class="flex gap-3"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-forest" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-charcoal/85">Unlimited weekday play on both courses</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-forest" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-charcoal/85">Tee times bookable 7 days ahead</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-forest" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-charcoal/85">Unlimited range access</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-forest" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-charcoal/85">Member dining rates</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-forest" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-charcoal/85">Two twilight guest passes a month</span></li></ul><div class="mt-auto pt-10"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-charcoal/50">By application</p><button aria-label="Enquire about Weekday membership" class="mt-4 flex h-12 w-full items-center justify-between rounded-full px-5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors border border-charcoal/20 hover:border-charcoal hover:bg-charcoal hover:text-bone" type="button">Enquire<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></article><article class="group flex flex-col rounded-[6px] border p-6 transition-[translate,box-shadow,border-color] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 lg:p-7 border-charcoal/15 bg-paper hover:border-charcoal/40 hover:shadow-[0_40px_80px_-50px_rgba(27,27,25,0.45)]" data-reveal="true"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/50">04</span></div><h3 class="type-wide mt-10 text-[1.7rem] font-medium uppercase leading-none">Academy</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal/65">Built around getting better.</p><ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-sm"><li class="flex gap-3"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-forest" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-charcoal/85">Unlimited range, short game and putting lab</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-forest" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-charcoal/85">12 private lessons a year with a PGA professional</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-forest" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-charcoal/85">A Performance Studio assessment every quarter</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-forest" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-charcoal/85">Unlimited play on the Short Nine</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-forest" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-charcoal/85">Twilight rounds on the Championship 18</span></li></ul><div class="mt-auto pt-10"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-charcoal/50">By application</p><button aria-label="Enquire about Academy membership" class="mt-4 flex h-12 w-full items-center justify-between rounded-full px-5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors border border-charcoal/20 hover:border-charcoal hover:bg-charcoal hover:text-bone" type="button">Enquire<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></article></div><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between" data-reveal="true"><p class="max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal/60">Every membership includes full clubhouse privileges and access to the Lodges at member rates. Fees and availability are shared personally once we receive your enquiry.</p></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="included-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-sand text-charcoal" id="included"><div class="px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70"><span class="tabular-nums">03</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Every membership</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.1rem,4.2vw,4.2rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em] [&amp;_em]:font-serif [&amp;_em]:font-normal" id="included-heading">What comes <em>with every card.</em></h2></div><p class="self-end text-base leading-relaxed lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9 text-charcoal/70" data-reveal="true">Whichever membership you choose, these are yours from the day your locker is named.</p></div><ol class="mt-14 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-12 lg:mt-20 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/45">01</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Priority tee sheet</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Member tee times open before guest times, with a quiet hour reserved every morning.</p><p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-clay">From 07:00 daily</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/45">02</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Guest privileges</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Bring friends and family at member-guest rates, with their lunch on the Terrace on us.</p><p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-clay">Member-guest rates</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/45">03</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">The Lodges</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Member rates on all twenty-four lodges, for yourself or for visiting friends.</p><p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-clay">Priority at weekends</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/45">04</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Member calendar</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Monthly medals, the Founders’ Cup, winter foursomes and long summer evenings on the Short Nine.</p><p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-clay">Twelve competitions a year</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/45">05</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Club care</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">A timber locker, bag storage and clubs cleaned after every round, with regripping in the pro shop.</p><p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-clay">Included</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/45">06</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Dining</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Member rates at the Terrace and the Cellar Room, and first call on the Map Room for private dinners.</p><p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-clay">Member rates</p></li></ol></div></section><section aria-labelledby="how-to-join-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-forest text-bone" id="how-to-join"><div class="px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-bone/70"><span class="tabular-nums">04</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>How to join</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.1rem,4.2vw,4.2rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em] [&amp;_em]:font-serif [&amp;_em]:font-normal" id="how-to-join-heading">Four steps <em>to your first member tee time.</em></h2></div></div><ol class="mt-14 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-12 lg:mt-20 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-bone/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-serif text-6xl leading-none text-ochre">01</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-6">Enquire</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">Tell us a little about your golf and the membership you have in mind. We reply within a day.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-bone/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-serif text-6xl leading-none text-ochre">02</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-6">Visit and play</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">Spend a day with us: a round with one of the team, lunch on the Terrace and a walk through the clubhouse.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-bone/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-serif text-6xl leading-none text-ochre">03</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-6">Meet the committee</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">An informal conversation over coffee. We simply want to know you will love the place as much as we do.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-bone/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-serif text-6xl leading-none text-ochre">04</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-6">Welcome</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">Your locker is named, your clubs are fitted and your first member tee time is waiting.</p></li></ol><div class="mt-14 lg:mt-20" data-reveal="true"><button class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-bone text-charcoal hover:bg-ochre" type="button">Start your enquiry<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="membership-questions-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-paper text-charcoal" id="membership-questions"><div class="grid gap-12 px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70"><span class="tabular-nums">05</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Questions</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.1rem,4vw,4rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em] [&amp;_em]:font-serif [&amp;_em]:font-normal" id="membership-questions-heading">Everything <em>members ask first.</em></h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-sm text-base leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70" data-reveal="true">For anything else, the membership team replies personally within a working day.</p></div></div><ul class="border-t lg:col-span-7 border-charcoal/15"><li class="border-b border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_qj6_-answer-0" aria-expanded="true" class="flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left lg:py-7" id="_R_qj6_-question-0" type="button"><span class="text-lg leading-snug sm:text-xl">How many members will Morrow have?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[rotate,background-color] duration-500 border-charcoal/20 rotate-45"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-hidden="false" aria-labelledby="_R_qj6_-question-0" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] grid-rows-[1fr]" id="_R_qj6_-answer-0" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Never more than 650 across all categories. When the club is full, applications join a waiting list in the order they arrive.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_qj6_-answer-1" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left lg:py-7" id="_R_qj6_-question-1" type="button"><span class="text-lg leading-snug sm:text-xl">Can I play the course before applying?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[rotate,background-color] duration-500 border-charcoal/20"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="_R_qj6_-question-1" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] grid-rows-[0fr]" id="_R_qj6_-answer-1" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Yes. Every applicant is invited for a day on the estate, including a round on the Championship 18 as our guest.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_qj6_-answer-2" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left lg:py-7" id="_R_qj6_-question-2" type="button"><span class="text-lg leading-snug sm:text-xl">Do you need a handicap to join?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[rotate,background-color] duration-500 border-charcoal/20"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="_R_qj6_-question-2" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] grid-rows-[0fr]" id="_R_qj6_-answer-2" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">No handicap is required for Weekday or Academy membership. Full and International members play the Championship tees with a handicap of 28 or better.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_qj6_-answer-3" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left lg:py-7" id="_R_qj6_-question-3" type="button"><span class="text-lg leading-snug sm:text-xl">Is there a family membership?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[rotate,background-color] duration-500 border-charcoal/20"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="_R_qj6_-question-3" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] grid-rows-[0fr]" id="_R_qj6_-answer-3" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Partners of Full members can join at a reduced rate, and children of members are welcome in the Junior Academy at no extra cost.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><h3><button aria-controls="_R_qj6_-answer-4" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-start justify-bet